extends baseEmail

block content
    p Hi #{firstName},
    p I wanted to say thanks for signing up on my portfolio website. Your support means a lot to me.
    p Your registration helps me improve my website, and your feedback is important. Feel free to explore the site and let me know your thoughts or any questions you have.
    p If you need help with anything, just reach out. I'm here to assist you.
    p Thanks again for joining. I'm excited to share more with you in the future.
    span Best,
    p Salvador Loiz Jr
